==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{der|fo|non|fagr}}, from {{der|fo|gem-pro|*fagraz}}, from {{der|fo|ine-pro|*ph₂ḱ-||to fasten, place}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|fo|/ˈfɛaːvʊɹ/}}
*: {{rhymes|fo|ɛaːvʊɹ|s=2}}

===Adjective===
{{fo-adj|fagrari|fagrastur}}

# [[beautiful]], [[fair]], [[pulchritudinous]]
#: {{ux|fo|'''fagrir''' [[litur|litir]]|t=beautiful colors}}
#: {{ux|fo|[[allur|alt]] [[er]] [[í]] '''fagrasta''' [[lag]]i|t=all is in best order}}
# {{lb|fo|weather}} very good
#: {{ux|fo|[[veður|veðrið]] [[var]] [[av]] [[tí]] '''fagrasta'''|t=the weather was of the best}}
# {{lb|fo|literature}} about [[fiction]]
#: {{ux|fo|'''fagrar''' [[bókmentir]]|t=fiction}}

